            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Narasimhan, S. and Dirzo, R. (2023). Stuck in the Matrix- Patch Matrix Dynamics in Florida Scrub. Stanford Digital Repository. Available at https://purl.stanford.edu/jv839mm8287. https://doi.org/10.25740/jv839mm8287.",
